      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "### Storage & staging \u2014 Postgres ODS (row store) and DuckDB SDI mart (column store)\nSnapshots are taken by `sdi_05_storage_metrics` after every refresh: row counts (`SELECT COUNT(*)`), physical size (Postgres `pg_total_relation_size`, DuckDB storage blocks, `os.path.getsize` of the files) and date coverage (min/max date and distinct year-month partitions per source)."
      }
